  "text": "I thought it was going to be clean and bright."
 },
 {
  "start": 30.92,
  "end": 33.06,
  "text": "It's all looking for, and it's all I'm concerned."
 },
 {
  "start": 33.36,
  "end": 33.66,
  "text": "Thank you."
 },
 {
  "start": 35.14,
  "end": 38.2,
  "text": "Andrew's a lot of decided not to continue"
