  "text": "after getting beaten up for two rounds by Mike Tyson."
 },
 {
  "start": 45.12,
  "end": 46.46,
  "text": "And my sorry for him."
 },
 {
  "start": 49.86,
  "end": 54.38,
  "text": "By 2000 people were beginning to wonder if Mike Tyson was finished."
 },
 {
  "start": 54.94,
  "end": 57.18,
  "text": "Prison had changed and Holyfield had beaten him."
 },
 {
  "start": 60.48,
  "end": 62.34,
  "text": "Douglas had shattered the myth."
 },
 {
  "start": 68.06,
  "end": 74.0,
  "text": "But one brutal night, Iron Mike reminded the entire boxing world exactly who he was."
 },
 {
  "start": 74.68,
  "end": 76.9,
  "text": "October 20th, 2000 lost Vegas."
 },
 {
  "start": 77.54,
  "end": 81.82,
  "text": "Nearly 14,000 fans packed the arena hoping to witness one thing."
 },
 {
  "start": 82.12,
  "end": 88.08,
  "text": "Either Tyson's final collapse or the rebirth of the most feared man boxing had ever seen."
 },
 {
  "start": 88.08,
  "end": 92.16,
  "text": "Only a few years early, Mike Tyson wasn't just heavyweight champion."
 },
 {
  "start": 92.78,
  "end": 94.08,
  "text": "He was boxing itself."
 },
 {
  "start": 96.94,
  "end": 98.74,
  "text": "But everything had changed."
 },
 {
  "start": 99.14,
  "end": 102.18,
  "text": "Prison, controversy, defeat, suspension."
 },
 {
  "start": 102.68,
  "end": 105.76,
  "text": "For the first time, people believed Tyson was vulnerable."
 },
 {
  "start": 106.36,
  "end": 109.1,
  "text": "Standing across the ring wasn't an ordinary challenger."
 },
 {
  "start": 109.7,
  "end": 112.76,
  "text": "Andrew Galata was one of heavyweight boxing's biggest mysteries,"
 },
 {
  "start": 113.14,
  "end": 115.64,
  "text": "six foot four, nearly 250 pounds."
 },
 {
  "start": 118.08,
  "end": 123.3,
  "text": "Then 240 pounds with a record of 36 wins for losses."
 },
 {
  "start": 123.58,
  "end": 126.9,
  "text": "Olympic bronze medalist, elite jab, elite power."
 },
 {
  "start": 127.28,
  "end": 129.76,
  "text": "But an even bigger reputation."
 },
 {
  "start": 130.42,
  "end": 134.48,
  "text": "For completely losing control, talent had never been Galota's problem."
 },
 {
  "start": 134.66,
  "end": 136.86,
  "text": "It was everything that happened after the bell rang."
 },
 {
  "start": 137.06,
  "end": 138.08,
  "text": "Here we go."
 },
 {
  "start": 138.94,
  "end": 140.84,
  "text": "A lot of looks a little soft in the belly, Tuesday."
 },
 {
  "start": 146.24,
  "end": 149.58,
  "text": "Tyson quickly looking to get in on the inside."
 },
 {
  "start": 150.54,
  "end": 151.58,
  "text": "Tyson promised violence."
 },
 {
  "start": 152.02,
  "end": 153.36,
  "text": "Galata promised discipline."
 },
 {
  "start": 153.84,
  "end": 155.9,
  "text": "Neither man planned on hearing the final bell."
 },
 {
  "start": 156.14,
  "end": 158.86,
  "text": "We already went through all the directions in the dressing room."
 },
 {
  "start": 159.2,
  "end": 160.24,
  "text": "Do you have any questions?"
 },
 {
  "start": 160.72,
  "end": 162.46,
  "text": "Any questions in this corner?"
 },
 {
  "start": 162.72,
  "end": 164.64,
  "text": "Tyson exploded from the opening bell."
 },
 {
  "start": 165.08,
  "end": 167.22,
  "text": "Every punch carried years of frustration."
 },
 {
  "start": 167.22,
  "end": 169.04,
  "text": "Straight left hand right on the nose."
 },
 {
  "start": 169.24,
  "end": 171.02,
  "text": "A right hand by Tyson."
 },
 {
  "start": 171.46,
  "end": 174.96,
  "text": "Another overhead right by Tyson that got Galata on the head."
 },
 {
  "start": 175.68,
  "end": 179.72,
  "text": "Galata immediately realized this wasn't the Tyson from newspaper headlines."
 },
 {
  "start": 180.04,
  "end": 181.92,
  "text": "This was the Tyson people used to fear."
 },
 {
  "start": 182.3,
  "end": 184.3,
  "text": "I was going to rip his heart out. I'm the best ever."
 },
 {
  "start": 184.6,
  "end": 187.72,
  "text": "I'm the most brutal and vicious and most ruthless champion that's ever been."
 },
 {
  "start": 187.98,
  "end": 189.0,
  "text": "There's no one can stop me."
 },
 {
  "start": 189.34,
  "end": 190.32,
  "text": "Links to the conqueror."
 },
 {
  "start": 190.4,
